OL,2,V55555555CPOLICE HUNT
OL,3,Vu5u5u5u5CMISSING SCHOOLGIRL
OL,4,Q
OL,5, Police have launched a hunt for a
OL,6, 12-year-old girl who went missing on
OL,7, her way to school in Pimlico, central
OL,8, London.
OL,10, Scotland Yard said the girl left home
OL,11, as normal yesterday but did not arrive
OL,12, at her school.
OL,14, Officers last night visited pubs in the
OL,15, area showing her photograph, in the
OL,16, hope that someone might have spotted
OL,17, her.
OL,19, She has not yet been named.
OL,23,F]DFrom 08-03-86 / teletextarchive.com
