OL,2,V55555555CCABBIES HEROES
OL,3,Vu5u5u5u5COF CAR INFERNO
OL,5, Firemen praised four heroic cabbies who
OL,6, braved an inferno to rescue eight
OL,7, teenagers trapped in a blazing car in
OL,8, Dagenham, Essex.
OL,10, They smashed windows to drag out the
OL,11, youngsters, whose clothes were ablaze.
OL,13, There were four boys and four girls
OL,14, aged between 16 and 18 in the car. Five
OL,15, were detained in hospital, two of them
OL,16, with serious burns.
OL,18, Fireman Colin Watts said: "If anyone
OL,19, deserves an award, it's these men. If
OL,20, they had not acted as they did, we
OL,21, would have had eight fatalities."
OL,24,ANext PageBT'text FilesCRewindFReg Radio
