OL,2,V55555555CUSA WANTS CUT IN
OL,3,Vu5u5u5u5CSOVIET DIPLOMATS
OL,4,B
OL,5, The US has told the Soviet Union it
OL,6, must reduce the number of diplomats in
OL,7, its United Nations missions by nearly
OL,8, 40% over the next two years.
OL,10, A US spokesman said the size of the
OL,11, Soviet, Byelorussian and Ukrainian
OL,12, missions "was not warranted by staffing
OL,13, needs for official UN business".
OL,15, "Moreover it poses a threat to US
OL,16, national security."
OL,18, The US is calling for a four-stage cut
OL,19, in the Soviet mission from 275 to 170
OL,20, by April 1988. A separate limit of 10
OL,21, will apply to the other two missions.
